ID: B3-Ch07a-Perform2
TEXT:

set(v_is_dead,0) if (v_b3_ch7_massage == 2 || v_combat_technique >= 4)
set(v_is_dead,1) if (v_combat_technique < 4 && v_b3_ch7_massage != 2)
#if(v_b3_ch7_massage == 2) {
 Over the next exchange, the giant's footwork matches the exact rhythm I anticipated. I slip his heavy swings until Leila draws his attention with a flashing dagger strike. The moment Gontrok turns, I close the distance and drive my rigid fingers into the final pressure cluster at the nape of his neck, sending his unstable aura into violent convulsions.

}
#if(v_combat_technique < 4 && v_b3_ch7_massage != 2) {
 Over the next exchange, the giant's footwork matches the rhythm I anticipated. I slip his heavy swings until Leila draws his attention with a flashing dagger strike. The moment Gontrok turns, I close the distance and drive my rigid fingers into the pressure points at the nape of his neck, trying to complete the disruption.

"Enough of this!" Gontrok bellows, pivoting with terrifying speed.

His feints accelerate into a blistering, chaotic flurry. Pushed past my limits, I misread a shift in his shoulders and lean directly into the path of an incoming fist. The blow shatters my skull on impact, sending my lifeless body tumbling to the stone.

}
#if(v_combat_technique >= 4 && v_b3_ch7_massage != 2) {
 Over the next exchange, the giant's footwork matches the rhythm I anticipated. I slip his heavy swings until Leila draws his attention with a flashing dagger strike. The moment Gontrok turns, I close the distance and drive my rigid fingers into the pressure points at the nape of his neck, trying to complete the disruption.

"Enough of this!" Gontrok bellows, pivoting with terrifying speed.

His feints accelerate into a blistering flurry. But with my advanced martial mastery, the subtle shifts in his center of gravity remain completely transparent. I slip beneath the barrage, holding his focus until Leila darts in to threaten his eyes. The moment his guard rises, I step behind him and drive three pinpoint strikes into his primary neck nodes. His aura fractures completely, collapsing into violent chaos.

}
#if(v_b3_ch7_massage == 2 || v_combat_technique >= 4) {
 "Ugh!" Gontrok stumbles, clamping both hands to his temples as his knees buckle. "What did you do, you treacherous little runt?!"

"Just induced a catastrophic migraine," I say. "Don't worry, it won't last long. One way or another. Leila, now!"

I sweep a low kick behind his knee and shove his shoulder, sending the off-balance giant crashing onto his back. As his arms flail out to break his fall, Leila drops from above, dagger points aligned straight with his pupils.

Before steel can pierce flesh, an ear-splitting screech rips through the cavern air. A wave of paralytic resonance crashes over our nervous systems, locking our limbs rigid. Our weapons slip from numbed fingers, clattering onto the stone floor.

Gontrok scrambles to his feet, clutching his throbbing head as he scans the shadows.

"I told you to stay out of my fights, illusionist!" Gontrok roars. "Show yourself! Where are you hiding?!"

"If you have a death wish, indulge it on your own time," the illusionist's disembodied voice echoes from every corner of the room. "The king gave you an order, and you will stay breathing until it is done."

The voice carries no directional trace, and his aura remains sealed behind an impenetrable shroud. Gontrok glares wildly at three different dark corners, looking just as bewildered as the rest of us.

}
choice("Continue", B3-Ch07a-Loyrang, v_ac_b3_ch7_honorable = 1, v_current_scene = B3-Ch07a-Loyrang) if (v_b3_ch7_massage == 2 || v_combat_technique >= 4)
